.godot/
.env

# Screenshots and review renders. Every test run rewrites these, so tracking
# them adds multi-megabyte blobs to history forever for output that is
# regenerated on demand. Docs reference them by path; run the review tool.
# .gdignore is kept so Godot does not import whatever lands here.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gdignore

# Historical model workflow: local compressed backup, never include in commits.
/art_source/workflows/starfall-character-forge-v1/
